# What the desktop image's build context leaves out.
#
# Two things about this file break the build outright if they change: its
# pattern style and its size. Both are explained in computer-image/README.md,
# and both are checked by computer-image/build.sh --check. Keep it terse.
#
# `src-tauri/src` is deliberately absent: the image copies two files out of it.
